  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b53d3a7811bb8498d9ae0485fd422ad9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day4_Legit_Room
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DontCallMe::DontCallMe.Data.RoomContent
  newspaper:
    masthead: SEOUL DAILY
    issue: No. 12,411
    dateLine: FRIDAY, OCTOBER 9, 2026
    price: 1,000 won
    headline: Fake customs desk used leaked AliStar orders
    subhead: The callers knew the item and the tracking number. The parcels had already
      cleared customs.
    photo: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4c63c0d2cf38942db834f06de02c655f, type: 3}
    caption: 'Before any transfer, the bank shows who really gets the money. Photo:
      Seoul Daily'
    body:
    - Callers posing as Hangang Express's "customs clearance desk" phoned AliStar
      customers in Mapo yesterday. They read out each customer's order and tracking
      number and asked for "unpaid duty" to be paid into an account before 5 p.m.
    - The details came from last month's AliStar data leak. The parcels had already
      cleared customs with their taxes paid, and the calls came from 1588-5502, one
      digit off Hangang Express's real number, 1588-5520.
    - '"If duty is due, our own notice says so, with an account in our name," a Hangang
      Express spokesperson said. "We never ask you to pay anyone else."'
    warningTitle: VIDEO CALLS CAN BE FAKED TOO
    warningText: 'Scammers now put a friend''s face on a live video call, made from
      a few of their public videos. Watch the lips against the voice, and ask for
      a slow wave in front of the face: a pasted face stays on top of the hand. Then
      ask them where you always talk.'
    print: {fileID: 0}
    local:
    - title: Hangul Day at Mangwon market
      text: Free calligraphy stalls by the main gate, 11:00-17:00.
    - title: Library hours
      text: Mapo Central Library is closed today and opens at 9:00 on Saturday.
    - title: Long weekend at the airports
      text: Gimpo and Incheon expect their busiest Friday since the summer.
    ads:
    - title: "\uCE58\uD0A8 CHICKEN 24H"
      text: Crispy & soy garlic. Free delivery over 20,000 won. 02-555-0147
    - title: CHECKFIRST.KR
      text: Who owns that number? Whose account is it? Look it up before you send.
    - title: HANBIT ACADEMY
      text: TOEIC weekend class, 30% off for students. 02-555-0166
  drawer:
